OL,4,CMan, 87, dies after being hit by car   
OL,5,GAn 87-year-old man has died after      
OL,6,Gbeing struck by a car in Larbert.      
OL,8,FEmergency crews responded after the    
OL,9,Fman was hit by a black Mazda 6 on the  
OL,10,FA88 Bellsdyke Road, near the junction  
OL,11,Fwith McCartney Road, at about 17:30 on 
OL,12,FFriday.                                
OL,14,FHe was pronounced dead at the scene a  
OL,15,Fshort time later. Police Scotland said 
OL,16,Fhis family had been made aware.        
OL,18,FThe road was closed for about six      
OL,19,Fhours to allow an initial              
OL,20,Finvestigation to take place.           
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
