OL,4,CFour charged over attempted murder of  
OL,5,Cman                                    
OL,6,GFour people have been charged in       
OL,7,Gconnection with the attempted murder   
OL,8,Gof a man in Aberdeen.                  
OL,10,FThe 42-year-old was taken to hospital  
OL,11,Ffollowing an incident on Seaview Road  
OL,12,Fin the Bridge of Don area at about     
OL,13,F09:00 on Friday.                       
OL,15,FA 46-year-old woman and three men,     
OL,16,Faged 36, 48 and 50, have been charged  
OL,17,Fover the incident.                     
OL,19,FThey are expected to appear at         
OL,20,FAberdeen Sheriff Court on Monday.      
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
